      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your tummy is swollen and firm on the left side.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:30",
      "end_timestamp": "05:36",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And there's no tenderness when I press. No wincing.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:43",
      "end_timestamp": "05:49",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right. So here's what I want to do. I'd like to arrange an abdominal X-ray, to see what's going on inside.",
